# Frontend environment example

This file contains example environment variables used by the frontend. Copy it to `.env.local` or the appropriate env file for your build process and fill in real values.

REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
# Optional: if you have a separate image upload service (not used by default)
# REACT_APP_IMAGE_UPLOAD_URL=https://api.imgupload.example/upload
# REACT_APP_IMAGE_UPLOAD_KEY=your-key
